    "body": "@annevk Wouldn't it be premature? My understanding is that [Fetch Metadata](https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-fetch-metadata/) will [eventually](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#goals) get merged into the Fetch standard. Correct? Until then, though, I'm not sure the Fetch standard should reference Fetch Metadata Request Headers like `Sec-Fetch-Mode`.",
